{"id": 17, "ts": 1780475485.4275253, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate the additional details on Candidate\u202fC \u2013 his calmness in a crisis, solid technical grasp, and ability to make correct decisions quickly are indeed valuable for long\u2011distance operations. However, the same evidence set also flags serious drawbacks: C struggles to communicate ideas, is perceived as egocentric, and shows little willingness to pursue further education. In a safety\u2011critical cockpit, clear, respectful communication and a growth mindset are non\u2011negotiable, especially on international routes where crew coordination and continuous learning are essential. Compared with Candidate\u202fA, who demonstrates strong situational awareness, excellent spatial vision, and proven leadership (despite a modest show\u2011off tendency), C\u2019s technical strengths are offset by his interpersonal and developmental limitations. Therefore, I maintain my provisional recommendation for **Candidate\u202fA** as the best overall fit at this stage."}
