{"id": 25, "ts": 1780475540.8958333, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I remain inclined to recommend **Candidate\u202fA**. James has now confirmed that Candidate\u202fD solves problems extremely well and can respond adequately to unexpected events, which are valuable technical and decision\u2011quality traits. However, D\u2019s \u201chot temper\u201d and \u201cknow\u2011it\u2011all\u201d perception raise serious doubts about crew cooperation and professional communication\u2014areas where we already have concrete concerns for A (show\u2011off attitude, limited openness to criticism). Compared with B\u2019s clear teamwork deficits (grumpy, uncooperative) and C\u2019s communication and growth\u2011mindset issues, A\u2019s leadership, situational awareness, and reliability still give the best overall safety profile, even if his adaptability needs monitoring."}
